      <p source="#source-395-426"><seg source="#source-395-426">俺は仕方ナク泣イタ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-426-458"><seg source="#source-426-458">電燈ガ煙草ヲフカシタ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-458-541"><seg source="#source-458-464">▽ハ</seg><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-464-530"><graphic url="fig53708_01.png" width="28px" height="26px"/><figDesc>１／ｗの図</figDesc></figure><seg source="#source-530-541">デアル</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-541-560"><seg source="#source-541-560">×</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-560-591"><seg source="#source-560-591">▽ヨ！　俺ハ苦シイ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-591-605"><seg source="#source-591-605">俺ハ遊ブ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-605-655"><seg source="#source-605-655">▽ノすりつぱーハ菓子ト同ジデナイ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-655-693"><seg source="#source-655-693">如何ニ俺ハ泣ケバヨイノカ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-693-712"><seg source="#source-693-712">×</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-712-738"><seg source="#source-712-738">淋シイ野原ヲ懐ヒ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-738-767"><seg source="#source-738-767">淋シイ雪ノ日ヲ懐ヒ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-767-798"><seg source="#source-767-798">俺ノ皮膚ヲ思ハナイ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-798-841"><seg source="#source-798-841">記憶ニ対シテ俺ハ剛体デアル</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-841-858"><seg source="#source-841-858">ホントウニ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-858-896">「一緒に歌ひなさいませ」</p>
      <p source="#source-896-955"><seg source="#source-896-955">ト云ツテ俺ノ膝ヲ叩イタ筈ノコトニ対シテ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-955-983"><seg source="#source-955-983">▽ハ俺ノ夢デアル</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-983-1035"><seg source="#source-983-1035">すてつき！　君ハ淋シク有名デアル</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1035-1052"><seg source="#source-1035-1052">ドウシヤゥ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-1052-1071"><seg source="#source-1052-1071">×</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1071-1118"><seg source="#source-1071-1118">遂ニ▽ヲ埋葬シタ雪景デアツタ。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1118-1172" style="padding-inline-end: 3em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-1148-1172"><seg source="#source-1148-1172">１９３１・６・５</seg></p>
      </div>
